  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_sitappa_01",
      "hash64": "0EBFEECAF3C69C0B",
      "text": "……哎，你怎么回事？\\n知道这儿是天星队的基地吗？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_sitappa_02",
      "hash64": "0EBFEFCAF3C69DBE",
      "text": "快点回去好不？\\n否则我就要正当防卫了哦。[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "F2512E54849FE70F",
      "text": "不回去！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "F2512F54849FE8C2",
      "text": "我回去……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "0EBFF0CAF3C69F71",
      "text": "嗯嗯，这样就好！\\n今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "0EBFF1CAF3C6A124",
      "text": "好！那我就通过正当防卫\\n把你打得落花流水！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "0EBFF2CAF3C6A2D7",
      "text": "你也太厉害了吧……[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "0EBFF3CAF3C6A48A",
      "text": "话说，莫非你是\\n向天星队挑衅的那个人？[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "F2513054849FEA75",
      "text": "正是在下",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "F2512954849FDE90",
      "text": "我叫[VAR 0x0100(0000)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "0EBFF4CAF3C6A63D",
      "text": "你回答得真有礼貌，谢谢！\\n这可真是糟透了！\\r\\n我要回伙伴那里去了！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "0EBFE5CAF3C68CC0",
      "text": "那么！今天星苦了～！！[VAR 0x0114(002F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "108E8F5BE65FE330",
      "text": "哎～！[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "108E925BE65FE849",
      "text": "仙后拜托我\\n调查火帮班的基地。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "108E915BE65FE696",
      "text": "调查结束了，所以我是想来帮你的，\\n但看来已经没这个必要了啊……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_poke_01",
      "hash64": "CD48B1C696AF2B4C",
      "text": "炭！炭炭！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "108E945BE65FEBAF",
      "text": "……嗯？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_poke_02",
      "hash64": "CD48B4C696AF3065",
      "text": "炭！炭！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "108E935BE65FE9FC",
      "text": "这家伙是……炭次郎？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_poke_03",
      "hash64": "CD48B3C696AF2EB2",
      "text": "炭！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "108E965BE65FEF15",
      "text": "果然没错！\\n为什么你会在这里……？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_select_05",
      "hash64": "F2512A54849FE043",
      "text": "这是老师的宝可梦？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_select_06",
      "hash64": "F2512B54849FE1F6",
      "text": "你们认识吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "108E955BE65FED62",
      "text": "这只宝可梦是炭小侍，\\n它叫炭次郎……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_poke_04",
      "hash64": "CD48AEC696AF2633",
      "text": "炭炭！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "108E985BE65FF27B",
      "text": "它是我平时在学院里\\n一直照料的宝可梦……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_poke_05",
      "hash64": "CD48ADC696AF2480",
      "text": "炭～！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "108E975BE65FF0C8",
      "text": "啊！炭次郎！[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "108B2A5BE65D01BA",
      "text": "……跑掉了。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_010_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "108B2B5BE65D036D",
      "text": "这恐怕和天星队火帮班\\n有什么关系……\\r\\n我先去追那孩子，然后再去基地！[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
